Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "PedestrianCrossing" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :BehaviorAnomaly ;
    :occursInScene :scene1 ;
    :hasActor :pedestrian1 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1 .

:pedestrian1 a :Pedestrian ;
    :description "Pedestrian walking across the road in front of the vehicle" .

:weather1 a :ClearCondition ;
    :description "Daytime clear weather conditions" .

:risk1 a :PedestrianCollisionRisk ;
    :description "High probability of collision due to pedestrian path intersection" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 ;
    :confidenceScore "0.95"^^xsd:float .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.90"^^xsd:float .

Identified Risks for each risk class
Risk 1:
Description: Pedestrian crossing in vehicle path
Severity Score: 0.90